  "sangamTamil": "கடக்கருங் கானத்துக் காளைபின் நாளை\nநடக்கவும் வல்லையோ என்றி - சுடர்த்தொடீஇ\nபெற்றா னொருவன் பெருங்குதிரை அந்நிலையே\nகற்றான் அஃதூரும் ஆறு.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The confidante demands of the bride if she can endure to walk after her beloved through the desert, she replies : 'Thou hast said, O maiden with burnished brace - lets ! have you strength to walk on the morrow after your beloved? When one (a warrior) has obtained a splendid horse, that very instant he has learned how to ride it! (his enthusiasm teaches him).",
